      "title": "Prompt Guard — Edit only USER PROMPT nodes",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Prompt architecture:\n- SYSTEM PROMPT / SYSTEM NEGATIVE = protected guard rails for identity preservation and stability.\n- USER PROMPT / USER NEGATIVE = the part you normally edit.\n- Final prompts are built automatically by concatenation before encoding.\n\nDaily use:\n1) Edit only `USER PROMPT`.\n2) Optionally edit `USER NEGATIVE`.\n3) Do not delete or rewrite `SYSTEM PROMPT` unless you intentionally want to change the global safety/identity behavior."
